The navigation system's license file contains a list of numbers that define a tree structure. Each node in the tree has a header specifying the number of child nodes and metadata entries, followed by the child nodes and metadata entries themselves. Given the list of numbers representing the license file, what is the sum of all metadata entries in the tree?

