In a casual game night, two friends decide to play either "Fifty" or "Pig". Who will emerge as the winner and what will be their final score?

The input and output requirements are as follows:

Input:
  `game_choice` (str): A string indicating the game to be played. It should be either "Fifty" or "Pig".
  `player_one_name` (str): A string representing the name of the first player.
